+
+    Idempotent: solaar's failure paths may close the same handle twice
+    (base.write closes on error, then Receiver.__del__ closes again), which
+    double-freed the OS handle and crashed with heap corruption (0xC0000374).
+    Track closed handles/tokens and skip repeats.
